'2016-11-30','Jo Yong Chol is a DPRK Ministry of State Security Official stationed in Syria supporting KOMID.',NULL,'DPRK Ministry of State Security Official','1973-09-30',NULL,'Good, Cho Yong Chol','Democratic Peoples Republic of Korea',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.885709'),(6,'6','KPi.035','KIM CHOL SAM  ','2016-11-30','Kim Chol Sam is a representative for Daedong Credit Bank (DCB) who has been involved in managing transactions on behalf of DCB Finance Limited. As an overseas-based representative of DCB, it is suspected that Kim Chol Sam has facilitated transactions worth hundreds of thousands of dollars and likely managed millions of dollars in DPRK related accounts with potential links to nuclear/missile programs.',NULL,'Representative for Daedong Credit Bank (DCB)','1971-03-11',NULL,'Good, Jin Tiesan (???)','Democratic Peoples Republic of Korea','Passport, 645120378',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.888807'),(7,'7','KPi.036','KIM SOK CHOL  ','2016-11-30','Kim Sok Chol acted as the DPRK Ambassador to Burma and he operates as a KOMID facilitator. He was paid by KOMID for his assistance and arranges meetings on behalf of KOMID, including a meeting between KOMID and Burmese defense related persons to discuss financial matters. ',NULL,'Former DPRK Ambassador to Burma','1955-05-08',NULL,NULL,'Democratic Peoples Republic of Korea','Passport, 472310082','Myanmar',NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.892093'),(8,'8','KPi.030','KIM SONG CHOL  ','2016-11-30','Kim Song Chol is a KOMID official that has conducted business in Sudan on behalf of KOMIDs interests. ',NULL,NULL,'1968-03-26, 1970-10-15',NULL,'Good, Kim Hak Song','Democratic Peoples Republic of Korea','Passport, 381420565, Passport, 654120219',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.895826'),(9,'9','KPi.032','KIM  SE GON   ','2016-11-30','Kim Se Gon works on behalf of the Ministry of Atomic Energy Industry. ',NULL,NULL,'1969-11-13',NULL,NULL,'Democratic Peoples Republic of Korea','Passport, PD472310104',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20: