rsame, Good, Mahad Mohamed Ali Karate, Good, Mahad Warsame Qalley Karate',NULL,NULL,'Somalia',NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.913344'),(14,'14','QDi.400','IYAD NAZMI  SALIH  KHALIL','2017-02-22','Leader of Al-Nusrah Front for the People of the Levant (QDe.137) for coastal area of Syrian Arab Republic since March 2016. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Good, Ayyad Nazmi Salih Khalil, Good, Eyad Nazmi Saleh Khalil, Low, Abu al-Darda, Low, Abu-Julaybib, Low, Abu-Julaybib al-Urduni, Low, Iyad al-Toubasi, Low, Iyad al-Tubasi','Jordan','Passport, Jordan 286062, Passport, Jordan 654781','Syrian Arab Republic',NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.916770'),(15,'15','QDi.343','ASHRAF MUHAMMAD YUSUF UTHMAN ABD AL-SALAM','2015-01-23','A member of Al-Qaida (QDe.004) as of 2012 and a fighter in the Syrian Arab Republic since early 2014. Provided financial, material, and technological support for Al-Qaida, Al-Nusrah Front for the People of the Levant (QDe.137) and Al-Qaida in Iraq (AQI) (QDe.115).Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 24 November 2020. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Good, Ashraf Muhammad Yusif Abd al-Salam, Good, Ashraf Muhammad Yusif Uthman Abd-al-Salam, Good, Ashraf Muhammad Yusuf Abd-al-Salam, Low, Ibn al-Khattab, Low, Khattab','Jordan','Passport, 486298, Passport, K048787','Syrian Arab Republic',NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.920846'),(16,'16','IRi.001','FEREIDOUN ABBASI-DAVANI  ','2007-03-24','Has links to the Institute of Applied Physics, working closely with Mohsen Fakhrizadeh-Mahabadi (designated under IRi.016) [Old Reference # I.47.C.1].',NULL,'Senior Ministry of Defence and Armed Forces Logistics (MODAFL) Scientist',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.924890'),(17,'17','TAi.155','ABDUL AZIZ ABBASIN  ','2011-10-04','Key commander in the Haqqani Network (TAe.012) under Sirajuddin Jallaloudine Haqqani (TAi.144). Taliban Shadow Governor for Orgun District, Paktika Province as of early 2010. Operated a training camp for non-Afghan fighters in Paktika Province. Has been involved in the transport of weapons to Afghanistan. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Paktika Province, Afghanistan','Good, Abdul Aziz Mahsud',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.928051'),(18,'18','QDi.012','NASHWAN ABD AL-RAZZAQ ABD AL-BAQI ','2001-10-06','Joined Al-Qaida in 1996 and was at that time an important liaison to the Taliban in Afghanistan. Received money from Ansar al-Islam (QDe.098) in order to conduct attacks in Kirkuk and Ninveh in Iraq during spring and summer of 2005. Al-Qaida senior official. In custody of the United States of America, as of Aug. 2014. Fathers name: Abd al-Razzaq Abd al-Baqi. Mothers name: Nadira Ayoub Asaad. Photo available for inclusion in the INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 15 Jun. 2010. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 24 November 2020. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Good, Abd Al-Hadi Al-Iraqi, Good, Abdal Al-Hadi Al-Iraqi, Good, Abdul Hadi Arif Ali, Good, Omar Uthman Mohammed, Low, Abd al-Hadi al-Ansari, Low, Abd al-Muhayman, Low, Abdul Hadi al-Taweel, Low, Abu Abdallah, Low, Abu Ayub','Iraq','National Identification Number, 0094195',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.931698'),(19,'20','QDi.192','ABD ALLAH MOHAMED RAGAB ABDEL RAHMAN','2005-09-29','Member of Egyptian Islamic Jihad (QDe.003). Reportedly killed in Syria in February 2017. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 1 Jun. 2010. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2253 (2015) was concluded on 21 Feb. 2019. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 15 November 2021. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals',NULL,NULL,'1957-11-03',NULL,'Good, Abu Al-Khayr, Good, Abu Jihad, Good, Ahmad Hasan','Egypt',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.935814'),(20,'21','TAi.121','AZIZIRAHMAN ABDUL AHAD  ','2001-01-25','Belongs to Hotak tribe. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 29 Jul. 2010. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals','Mr','Third Secretary, Taliban Embassy, Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates',NULL,'Kandahar Province, Afghanistan',NULL,'Afghanistan',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.939100'),(21,'22','TAi.024','ABDUL GHANI BARADAR ABDUL AHMAD TURK ','2001-02-23','Arrested in Feb. 2010 and in custody in Pakistan. Extradition request to Afghanistan pending in Lahore High Court, Pakistan as of June 2011. Belongs to Popalzai tribe. Senior Taliban military commander and member of Taliban Quetta Council as of May 2007. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 1 Jun. 2010. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals','Mullah','Deputy Minister of Defence under the Taliban regime',NULL,'Dehrawood District, Uruzgan Province, Afghanistan','Good, Abdul Ghani Baradar, Good, Mullah Baradar Akhund','Afghanistan',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 20:00:28.942109'),(22,'23','TAi.128','ABDUL QADEER BASIR ABDUL BASEER ','2001-01-25','Financial advisor to Taliban Peshawar Military Council and Head of Taliban Peshawar Financial Commission. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Review pursuant to 